  "runtime_observations": [
    "Root directly inspected the launcher, ordinary Garen spawn, fountain/base path, minion route beside the wall, gate, jungle camp and west altar through native application captures. Movement used ordinary right clicks and Y camera follow; no position, level or timing injection was used.",
    "The formerly offset plaza/wall geometry appeared coherent with Garen and minions along the inspected route. The gate and wall no longer showed the large old plaza gap in the comparable region. This is a bounded observation, not an identical-camera before/after comparison or proof for the whole map.",
    "Root directly observed remaining cyan and blue-gray openings behind jungle trees and beside the west altar, including a turquoise polygon at the lower-left edge of its base. Captures 07 through 11 preserve the visible defects.",
    "Garen reached the center of the west altar in capture 11. The archive shows ordinary gameplay time 9:39. No Vilemaw visit, combat, spell, inventory drag, HUD reconnection scenario or full match was qualified during this run.",
    "Archived startup and final probe analysis confirms the unique direct-coordinate map root, the eight selected floor assets and their ancestry/transforms, and the seventeen ambient placements. Both altar position bindings agree within the recorded tolerance. Inherited visibility does not prove a GPU draw or correct fog pixels.",
    "The launcher displayed Session terminee after normal client closure. Retained process handles reported exit code zero for the launcher, client and server. The observer also recorded an empty-path exception, so its owned_processes_closed_cleanly flag remains false. A separate elevated CIM query after closure returned no OpenLeague launcher, client or server process.",
    "Screenshots and probes were archived at different instants. File save times do not establish frame synchronization; later altar frames show a changed plate/grate state."
  ],
